  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Light is incident normally on the face&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AB</mi></math> of a prism as shown in the figure. A layer of liquid of refractive index <math><mi>μ</mi></math> is applied on the face&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AC</mi></math> of the prism. If the prism is made of glass of refractive index <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, then&nbsp;the limit of <math><mi>μ</mi></math> for which total internal reflection takes place on face&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AC</mi></math> is</p>\r\r<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/321225_que.JPG\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 157px;\" /></p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "eBmPT",
      "text": "<math><mi>μ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "w9oMF",
      "text": "<math><mi>μ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "hVvdm",
      "text": "<math><mi>μ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x4Fn7",
      "text": "<math><mi>μ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/0321225_sol.JPG\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 143px;\" /></p><p>For critical angle at&nbsp;the glass-liquid interface we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>90</mn><mo>°</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>For total internal reflection</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
